{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"一种很郑重的迟疑：像是刚要把事情认定下来，却马上发现原先以为可靠的把握并不够；因此既有想站稳的力量，也有一次次不能真正落定后的不安和悬置。\",\"thread\":\"这里的迟疑不是因为还什么都不知道，而是因为最初那份确定很快就证明不足以安顿眼前的事。人仍然认真地一次次靠近它，说明这件事不能被随便放下；可每次接近确定，都还有一部分没有被包含进去。于是郑重和不安会同时存在：越想认真承认它，越不能用一个过早的答案把它压平。\",\"used\":\"无\",\"new\":[\"最初看来可以依靠的确定，并不足以真正安顿这件事。\",\"这件事具有不能轻易绕开的分量，所以即使无法落定，人仍会继续靠近和辨认它。\",\"反复不能落定并不只是空白，它已经让人知道：眼前的困难不能靠一个过早而完整的答案解决。\"],\"unexplained\":\"这一段为什么在迟疑之中仍隐约带着一种可以继续承受的稳定感，还没有完全解释。\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "55ff9ea4-f525-43f2-be02-e2039dbc1fa2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224037551425Z", "elapsed_seconds": 18.563, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:40:56.107202+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e2ced3baca6da554a9edcb4a613b5d1d1ea068523c94dab08307893df8a96502", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d